  "description": "About The Event: Think you’re the best coder in your college? Prove it against the best from other colleges, win cash prizes, and get a certificate, all for free. Code in Java or Python on 21st November 2026 at CEM Kolaghat. Prizes And Rewards: 1st: ₹5,000 2nd: ₹3,000 3rd: ₹2,000 Certificates for participants Free lunch for every participant Event Details: Date: Saturday, 21st November 2026 Reporting Time: 10:30 AM Commencement: 11:00 AM Venue: College of Engineering & Management, Kolaghat (offline, on campus) Languages: Java / Python Registration Fee: FREE Last Date to Register: 15th November 2026, 11:59 PM Eligibility: Open to students from all colleges. (only UG) Competition Format: Individual participation only (no teams) Depending on the number of participants, the contest may have more than one round. Every participant is provided a computer inside the contest hall. Winners (1st, 2nd, 3rd) will be announced at the valedictory session on the same day. Rules And Regulations: Participation is individual only. No travelling allowance (TA) will be reimbursed. Every contestant must carry their latest college ID card. Participation will be rejected without it. A computer will be provided to every participant inside the contest hall. No electronic gadgets (laptop, mobile phone, smart watch, pendrive, memory card) are allowed inside the contest hall. Late arrivals will not be allowed, so report by 10:30 AM. E-certificates will be emailed to all participants a few days after the contest. Prize money will be given by cheque along with a printed certificate of merit. Contact Details: Mr. Subhrangsu Das (TAC Advisor & Mentor): +91 7908957796 Email: subhrangsudas31@gmail.com (9 AM – 9 PM) Instagram: @tac_cemkolaghat Register now and code your way to victory!",
